# Burn Together (CR 608.2b, official ruling): Bot2 bolts Bot1's Simian Spirit Guide in response. The first target is illegal, but the other target
# is still legal, so the spell does not fizzle: it resolves, deals no damage and sacrifices nothing, and because it resolved the Adventure card is
# exiled (CR 715.4), not put into the graveyard. The Elvish Spirit Guide is untouched.

